/licenses/bsd-3-clause","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTU="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["framework","hacktoberfest","php","php-framework","yii","yii2"],"visibility":"public","forks":6857,"open_issues":521,"watchers":14308,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"There is still a problem with the number formatting described in #3756. The problem occurs if you pass a string to the function `asShortSize`, which is the case if you pass the variable directly from DB.\n\n``` php\nvar_dump(\n    Yii::$app->formatter->asShortSize(28406984038),\n    Yii::$app->formatter->asShortSize((string)28406984038),\n    Yii::$app->formatter->asShortSize((28406984038 + 28406984038)),\n    Yii::$app->formatter->asShortSize((string)(28406984038 + 28406984038))\n);\n```\n\noutput\n\n```\nstring(9) \"28,407 GB\"\nstring(8) \"2,147 GB\"\nstring(9) \"56,814 GB\"\nstring(8) \"2,147 GB\"\n```\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/8203/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/8203/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]